    <worksheet name='Premium by Model'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Does the premium survive controls?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>About half of the raw premium comes from bigger-budget and franchise films being scheduled in holiday windows. After controls, a 50-60% premium remains.</run>
