              <zone h='11665' id='11' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='79585'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Models: (1) year fixed effects; (2) same, films with known budget; (3) + budget, franchise, MPA rating; (4) + IMDb rating; (5) + release month. Premium = genre x window interaction in an OLS on log domestic gross, robust standard errors.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
