            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Caveats: observational data, so controls reduce but do not remove selection bias. IMDb rating is measured after release. Only 35-40 matched films fall in each window, so intervals are wide.</run>
            </formatted-text>
